200 MHz Vortex86 SoC (SiS-55x) eBox-2300.
TendyStar G2 bluetooth headset.
Plain 2.6.25-rc8, uClibc/BusyBox/libglib2, bluez-libs/utils 3.30, ALSA 1.0.16.

Blacklisted most modules on modprobe.conf, and started only udevd, dbus-daemon 
and hcid.  Removed all hcid plugins except libaudio.

speaker-test -D headset --rate 8000 --buffer 1000000

(a few minutes of noise)

